This product is an independent interoperability implementation of the
JetKVM local network API. It contains no source code from the JetKVM
project (github.com/jetkvm/kvm, GPL-2.0). Protocol behavior documented
here was derived from public protocol observation and the uncopyrightable
functional facts of the device's wire protocol, and from the public
USB-IF HID Usage Tables specification for keyboard usage IDs.

Third-party components used at runtime:
- werift (MIT) — WebRTC implementation
- puppeteer-core (Apache-2.0) — headless Chromium control (browser engine)
- yaml (ISC) — configuration parsing

The optional `recorder` screenshot engine shells out to the external
`recorder-for-jetkvm` binary if installed; that binary is not distributed
with this package.
